#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1968
msgid ""
"Cemu, the Wii U emulator, by the Cemu team and its contributors; RADV on the PS5 by Mihawk-99 and mpereiraesaa; the community graphic packs' authors.\n"
"Azahar, the 3DS emulator, by the Azahar team and the Citra contributors before them; Mihawk-99's PS5 port of it and dynarmic.\n"
"melonDS, the DS emulator, by Arisotura and the melonDS team.\n"
"Eden, the Switch emulator, by the Eden team; ProsperoEden, its PS5 port and launcher, by Sword, BlackBearReloaded, bawsdeep, Rockiu0 and its contributors.\n"
"Box art and game information: GameTDB. The font: Lexend. The remote touch screen: dolphin78's idea and prototype.\n"
"An unofficial port, not affiliated with the Cemu, Azahar, melonDS or Eden teams, Nintendo or Sony.\n"
"\n"
"Wii U games: {4}, storage and saves: {3}/mlc01, keys: {3}/keys.txt\n"
"3DS games: {5}/games, storage: {5}/sdmc\n"
"DS games: {6}/games, saves: {6}/saves\n"
"Switch games: {2}/roms, keys: {2}/keys, firmware: {2}/firmware\n"
"\n"
"Version {0}"
msgstr ""
"Cemu(Wii U 에뮬레이터): Cemu 팀과 기여자. PS5의 RADV: Mihawk-99, mpereiraesaa. 커뮤니티 그래픽 팩 제작자들.\n"
"Azahar(3DS 에뮬레이터): Azahar 팀과 그 이전의 Citra 기여자. Mihawk-99의 PS5 이식과 dynarmic.\n"
"melonDS(DS 에뮬레이터): Arisotura와 melonDS 팀.\n"
"Eden(Switch 에뮬레이터)은 Eden 팀, 그 PS5 이식판이자 런처인 ProsperoEden은 Sword, BlackBearReloaded, bawsdeep, Rockiu0와 기여자들이 만들었습니다.\n"
"표지와 게임 정보: GameTDB. 글꼴: Lexend. 원격 터치스크린: dolphin78의 아이디어와 프로토타입.\n"
"비공식 이식판이며, Cemu, Azahar, melonDS, Eden 팀이나 닌텐도, 소니와는 관계가 없습니다.\n"
"\n"
"Wii U 게임: {4}, 저장 공간 및 세이브 데이터: {3}/mlc01, 키: {3}/keys.txt\n"
